    "docs/synth-scsp/index.html": {
      "before": {
        "bytes": 43785,
        "sha256": "a60d1e9fbaf10a0136a6176a4aee3983ba674a660f1faaec3a6260a51d0ca85b"
      },
      "after": {
        "bytes": 44106,
        "sha256": "20fa933b41fd2bac5108b715a5f7b1151221b25262fbe30f6be7e35f87721e68"
      },
      "reverseHunks": [
        {
          "afterOffset": 515,
          "afterBytes": 71,
          "beforeText": "\t\t<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"synth.css?v=scsp-fm-multi-self-1\" />\n"
        },
        {
          "afterOffset": 17715,
          "afterBytes": 886,
          "beforeText": "\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>In Custom 2 / 4 / 6OP, one OP can feed itself using X32/Y0, averaging two sound-stack histories. Selecting Self for Input X replaces that OP's external inputs and reserves both taps; Input Y is disabled. Other OPs can receive its output. Depth 0 is Off in this Synth adapter. Auto and Code clear only that OP's two history cells at a new note; live Depth edits keep history. This initialization is Synth software.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>This graph editor and its voice allocation are Synth software over SCSP slot modulation. Custom accepts acyclic 2 / 4 / 6OP connections plus one Self OP. Multiple Self OPs and multi-OP cycles remain outside this editor; raw physical CH controls keep their existing behavior.</p>\n"
        },
        {
          "afterOffset": 18889,
          "afterBytes": 403,
          "beforeText": "\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Changing OP count keeps surviving Self connections; shrinking removes routes and outputs for removed OPs. The zero-delay editor core's steady Self histories are one and two native 44.1 kHz samples old; full physical SCSP pipeline accuracy is not implied.</p>\n"
        },
        {
          "afterOffset": 43434,
          "afterBytes": 128,
          "beforeText": "\t\t\t\t\t\ttwo external inputs per operator, with one Self-feedback OP in Custom 2 / 4 / 6OP. General cyclic\n"
        },
        {
          "afterOffset": 44014,
          "afterBytes": 75,
          "beforeText": "\t\t<script type=\"module\" src=\"synth.js?v=scsp-fm-multi-self-1\"></script>\n"
        }
      ]
    },
